{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>港股失守兩萬四關口，跌逾300點。</p><p></p><p>聯想跌一成三，是半日跌幅最大藍籌。晶片及人工智能(AI)相關股份有沽壓，華虹宏力跌逾百分之8。科網股有份拖低大市，百度及阿里巴巴跌逾百分之4。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-15T07:47:35.193969+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":89,"images":0,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-15T05:28:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-15T08:37:57.376059+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-15T07:40:59.185967+00:00","content_hash":"6ff03dbffaf2ee1e8645d0663e3e833473ec1f43689e2312e69a35d414c4cd1b","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}